      "v": 6,
      "zh": "若有无可指责的人，只作一个妇人的丈夫，儿女也是信主的，没有人告他们是放荡不服约束的，就可以设立。",
      "en": "An elder must be blameless,[NOTE:1] the husband of one wife,[NOTE:2] with faithful children[NOTE:3] who cannot be charged with dissipation or rebellion.",
